  diseaseId: hyperthyroidism
  diseaseName: "H\u0130PERT\u0130RO\u0130D\u0130"
  generalInfo: "Hipertiroidi, tiroid bezinin fazla hormon \xFCretmesiyle geli\u015Fen
    metabolik bir hastal\u0131kt\u0131r. Hastalarda \xE7arp\u0131nt\u0131, kilo kayb\u0131
    ve \u0131s\u0131 intolerans\u0131 g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "S\u0131k \xE7arp\u0131nt\u0131, i\u015Ftah iyi ama kilo kayb\u0131
    var olmas\u0131, \u0131s\u0131 intolerans\u0131 mevcut olmas\u0131 ve elde titreme
    var olmas\u0131 hipertiroidide s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir. Baz\u0131
    hastalarda bacaklarda \xE7abuk yorulma var olabilir."
